WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:05.230
Kanata-chan is always working hard.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.440
Whether it be my part-time job
five days a week,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.820
or me cooking...

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.070
If it means that I get to see
my precious Haruka-chan's smile...

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.280
It's so good!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.490
...bring on the world.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.250
Where's Mom?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.870
She's got the night shift,
so I think she already left.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.170
I see...

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:33.880
Say, Sis. I'm going to be
in a concert this Sunday.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.850
Really? That's great! Where is it going to be?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.770
Venus Fort in Odaiba.
I was actually picked as the center.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.400
I'm going to be there in the first row!

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.980
That's so cool...

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.320
You're the center of the School Idol Club
at Shinonome Academy...

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.280
Well, you were working pretty hard.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.120
I want to see your concert soon, too, Sis.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:04.620
I want you to see it soon, too.

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.850
Morning, Sis.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.690
Morning... You're up early today.

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:35.190
Yeah, I thought I'd help you out.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:39.450
You don't have to. Take it easy, Haruka-chan.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:40.370
But...

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.620
I'm almost done, so just sit tight.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.790
Sis!

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:53.340
Say, can I come check out
your School Idol Club today?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.680
I would love for you to come!

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:05.310
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.070
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.070
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.000
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.750
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.750
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.130
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:41.640
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.850
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:47.430
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.600
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:55.400
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.070
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.950
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.410
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.750
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.120
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.340
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.750
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.420
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:25.470
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.390
Ta-da!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.810
This is Haruka-chan.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.400
Thank you for having me here today.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.400
Oh, my gosh! Wow!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:44.570
I can't believe I get to meet the most popular
girl at Shinonome Academy, Haruka Konoe-chan!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.580
I'm so thrilled!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.700
You're too kind.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.620
I guess you're checking out
school idols from other schools, too.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.330
I mean, it's <i>the</i> Shinonome Academy!

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.800
It's one of the most famous
School Idol Clubs in the whole city

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.670
and she's all a buzz as a first-year
everyone's rooting for on the internet.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:06.680
She totally is. You know your stuff, Yu-chan.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:10.180
I know this was sudden, so thank you very much.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.390
No, no, we're honored to have you here.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.980
She's cute and proper? What an angel!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.770
I know, right?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:24.070
She said she wanted to
come see the School Idol Club

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.280
because I seem like I've been
having so much fun lately.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:31.790
Yeah! You look like you've been having
a blast at all our practices, Kanata-san!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:36.540
Kanata-chan is on another level today.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:41.550
It's so lovely that you wanted to
see how your sister is doing.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.670
Yeah! All right!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:50.470
Let's have Haruka-chan see all the amazing
things Niji High's school idols can do!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.060
She may be Kanata-senpai's younger sister,

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.310
but that doesn't change the fact that
she came to check out the enemy!

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:03.900
Let's show her how much of a dark horse
we can be as school idols.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.360
Um...

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.280
Remember, other school idols may be
our rivals, but they're not our enemy...

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.780
No, they absolutely are our enemies!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:15.040
And she's a first-year just like me,
so the fact that she's getting praised--

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.170
I mean, acknowledged online
is making me envious...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.090
I mean, frustrated!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.460
Don't you agree, Shizuko?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.590
Huh? Not really...

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.550
Well, you should!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.510
Wow, Kasumin. You're all fired up!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.930
I, the club president, will prove to
Shinonome Academy's School Idol Club

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.980
that we are true contenders!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.400
Wait, you're the club president, Kasumin?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.110
Self-proclaimed...

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.570
But if we're talking about notoriety,
the difference between us and Shinonome Academy

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.030
is like night and day.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.910
You don't have to say it like that...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.790
We are getting pretty famous
at our school, though.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.620
I borrowed a tea set!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.960
I can't wait to meet Haruka-chan.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:07.130
Yeah. Kanata-san always says
she's as cute as an angel.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.300
But I'm cuter!

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.140
Okay, Ai am gonna go all out!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.680
You know, because my name is Ai! JK!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.810
I'm Haruka Konoe.
It's very nice to meet you all.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.360
Likewise.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.440
I hope you have a blast!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.740
It's a pleasure.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.410
We've been waiting for you!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.700
Hi...

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.410
Rina-chan Board, teehee!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.540
Wow, thank you so much!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.370
Nice to meet you!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.830
Your cuteness has met its match!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.750
I'm the special school idol Kasumin,
AKA Kasumi Nakasu!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:48.800
Thank you so much for coming
to see Kasumin today...

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.180
Huh?!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:54.430
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.310
Haruka-chan!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.940
I never knew my sister could run so fast.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:12.740
Yup! Ever since our club started back up,
Kanata-san has been working super hard.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.910
I see...

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.510
Great job, Kanata-san.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:34.220
--I think you're doing better than yesterday.
--You can do it, Sis!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.180
You're amazing, Kanata-san!
This is the lowest you've gotten!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.980
You've got this, Sis!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.270
Kanata-san?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.190
Way to go, Kanata-san. Well done.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.650
You're doing great!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.570
I think we can call it a day.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.040
Now, we can officially say...

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.870
Welcome to the Nijigasaki
High School Idol Club!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.750
Wow! It's the real deal.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.340
I'm glad you're so pleased.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.380
Here, have a seat!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.260
Oh, thanks.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:16.220
We put this together in a hurry, so we only
had time to bake cookies for snacks.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.640
Well, I prepared my special buns!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.060
How cute!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.650
You flatter me, as you should.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.030
Haruka-chan, this is my fave!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.320
In that case...

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.740
It's so good!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.030
Make sure you have plenty of cookies, too.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.910
Yeah, before Emma eats them all.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.910
Karin-chan!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.880
So, what did you think of us?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.760
Oh, right. All of you and my sister
looked like you were having a lot of fun.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.300
You all practice in various ways
to fit your individual needs.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.930
It's a very lovely club.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:00.890
Really? I'm so happy to hear that!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.270
Sis?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.980
Oh, don't worry.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.690
We have a pillow ready for her.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:14.400
Kanata-chan really loves this pillow.
Apparently, it's super comfy.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.870
Um, does my sister fall asleep often?

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:23.250
Yes, as far as I know,
Kanata-san loves to sleep when she can.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.080
She really loves using our laps as pillows.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.830
Lap pillows?!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.590
Yup! I let her use mine, too!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:37.930
So my sister is sleeping so much that
she's been using your laps as pillows?

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:43.180
Come to think of it, I think she's been
even more sleepy lately.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.930
Yeah.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:49.480
She fell asleep while practicing.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.940
The other day, she was so deeply
asleep that she barely woke up.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.820
Kanata-chan?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.200
I'm basically everyone's cheerleader.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.120
Oh, I see.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.370
Huh?

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.210
Are you awake?

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:16.220
You've seen my embarrassing secret!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.880
There's nothing embarrassing
about it at all, Sis!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.640
Of course you're tired!
You do nothing but push yourself too hard.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.100
I push myself too hard? Like how?

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.640
I knew it...

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.190
Haruka-chan?

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:35.150
You haven't been sleeping much ever since
the club started back up again, have you?

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.070
Yeah, because I've been having so much fun.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:44.160
I've been so worried that you might
pass out from working too hard.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:47.000
That's why I came to check on you today.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.870
That's why you came?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:54.710
But you seemed so energetic and happy
that you almost didn't seem tired at all,

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.460
so I was happy.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.760
You always put me first,

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.260
so I was happy that it seemed like
you found something you loved.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.560
Haruka-chan...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:12.310
I realize how important
this School Idol Club is to you, Sis.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.900
So I've made up my mind.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.280
About what?

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.990
I'm going to quit being a school idol.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.330
What?!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.960
Q-Quit? But why...

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.370
Why?!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:36.670
Because at this rate,
you're going to make yourself sick.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:41.760
Did I worry you because I fell asleep?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.220
But I'm fine!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.100
You're not fine at all!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:50.310
You've been doing everything at home
because Mom's been busy,

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.690
then you've been working part-time
because you want to help out our finances.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:57.110
And you're on a scholarship
so you've been studying hard, too.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:01.360
Being a school idol on top of that
would make anyone pass out!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.870
It's okay.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.330
Don't worry about me.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:15.330
I want you to be able to do
what you want to your heart's content.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.630
Haruka-chan...

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.510
Um...

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:23.760
Is that why you're going to
quit being a school idol?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:24.640
Yes.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:29.470
N-No! You can't give up
your dream, Haruka-chan!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:35.270
I can't pursue my dreams
knowing you're killing yourself!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.440
But you don't need to worry about me!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.530
You're my precious little sister!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.700
Why...

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:49.080
Why should the fact that I'm the little sister
mean I don't need to worry?

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:54.830
I'm sorry I made you worry.
I'll work even harder...

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.710
You just don't understand, Sis!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.050
Haruka-chan!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.090
I'll go check on her.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.850
H-Haruka-chan...

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.680
...got mad...

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.570
Haruka-chan!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:28.450
Are you serious about quitting?

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.530
Yes.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.160
Are you really okay with that?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.960
I've already made up my mind.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:43.420
All the burdens my sister had taken on
should be taken on by me now.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.220
Please look after my sister for me.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.740
Haruka-chan...

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.410
--Um...
--So, last night...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:19.170
I tried to talk to Haruka-chan.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.050
Thanks for the food.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.800
Hey, you don't have to...

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.600
Let's not talk about that anymore.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:36.890
I'm not quitting because
I want to pick a fight with you.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.100
So make sure you come to my upcoming concert.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:47.440
What am I even supposed to say to that?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:51.700
Haruka-chan finally became a school idol...

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.830
If I worried her so much

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.580
that she's going to quit,

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.870
then I should be the one to...

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.330
You can't!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.510
Kanata-chan...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.890
Is that what you really want?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.520
No.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.440
My wish...

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.770
The dream I've been looking for
all this time is right here.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:30.700
Ever since the club started back up,
I've been having so much fun.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.820
There's so much more that I want to do now.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:39.410
And I'm happy that I get to
chase that dream with all of you.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:45.210
Our School Idol Club is
a very precious place to me

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.800
that I never ever want to lose.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:53.300
But I also want to protect
Haruka-chan's happiness.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.470
I know I'm being selfish.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.140
Are you, though?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:03.690
Is that being selfish or
just being honest with yourself?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:08.400
Yeah, I think that's way better
than lying to yourself.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:13.660
And I'm sure that Haruka-chan
wants to protect your happiness, too.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.280
You two are really alike.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.160
We're alike?

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:21.540
I mean, you two basically say the same thing.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:26.880
Indeed. And you're both trying to
figure this all out on your own.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.800
But I have to protect Haruka-chan!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:36.970
Kanata-san, I don't think Haruka-chan
needs that much protection anymore.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:43.060
I mean, otherwise, she wouldn't be so earnest
about wanting to help her big sister out.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:54.110
I think I sorta get it.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.540
But I need to tell Haruka-chan!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.630
Haruka-san, you have guests.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.760
Thank you for coming.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:21.470
Um... Is my sister not with you?
I really wanted her to watch me today.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:22.390
Because it's my...

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.350
Haruka-chan, Kanata-san is waiting for you.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.940
--Come with me!
--What?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.990
Wait, what's going on?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:58.390
Hey... Now, listen

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:06.310
You are my first and most precious

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.560
You're my dearest treasure

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:15.400
My memories are overflowing
with love with you

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.700
I'm always running around day by day

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.950
We hold hands as time goes by

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:28.210
I've gotten stronger because of your warmth

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.920
If I'm all alone

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:34.960
Even if I hold out my arms
as far as they'll go

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:39.590
Our dreams are so big
that they can't be contained

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.720
So let's embrace them together

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.770
Butterfly, if I spread my wings

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:49.270
I can fly high into the great beyond

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.610
Beyond that courage

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:55.110
Lies a beautiful sky

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.030
Butterfly

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.150
Fly into your dreams

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.660
And let's welcome the season
of flowers together

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.580
I know we can make this come true

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.370
Believe that we can fly!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:28.390
Sis, that was an amazing performance!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.600
Haruka-chan...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:35.690
I'm really sorry that I didn't
understand you, Haruka-chan.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:42.530
You care about me so much.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.030
Thank you for that.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:48.790
So hey, since we both feel the same,

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.710
I think we can continue by
supporting each other.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.840
Supporting each other?

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.210
Help me out lots at home,

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:02.430
and continue supporting
each other as school idols.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:05.430
Let's make our dreams come true together.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.560
You're okay with that, Sis?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.560
Being a school idol while working
part-time is going to be super hard.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.270
Oh, I'm fine!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:20.030
Because making my precious little
Haruka-chan a school idol is also my dream.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.240
Sis...

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:28.290
Oh? Wouldn't it frustrate you if you quit
today after you saw Kanata-chan

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:32.000
put on such a lovely performance?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.830
Actually... It would.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:41.130
We're rivals as school idols.
Let's both do our best.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.140
Yeah!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:49.560
--I'm so excited for your
performance, Haruka-chan.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.020
--It appears she's decided to continue.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:52.770
--It appears she's decided to continue.
--I'll do my best, Sis.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:57.690
--Thank you very much for letting us
borrow your stage on such short notice.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.150
But you were able to save one of
our members because of that.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.070
And...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:05.660
It was such a lovely performance
that I'm feeling even more motivated now.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.040
Oh, no...

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.580
I'm gonna eat that.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:21.010
You should eat the prettier one, Sis!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.920
It's fine.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.630
It's not!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:30.720
Maybe I should be the one who works
part time, and you should cook, Sis...

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.890
No part-time jobs for you.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.270
You're so overprotective.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:42.190
Pout all you want. I'm just happy
I get to eat your cooking.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.740
Oh, jeez!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:50.240
Show me how to cook again during dinner.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.790
Of course!

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.010
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:15.890
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:22.730
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:25.530
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.420
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:42.880
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:50.970
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:55.350
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:55.350 --> 00:22:58.440
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:02.940
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:08.820
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:17.290
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:21.500
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.390
Next time, "Shizuku, Monochrome."
